<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
lgu.deliveryMapping hook (Target mapping — lguMMS inline input)
================================================================
★ Form Import 파일 아님 ★  nms:deliveryMapping Address 탭에 아래 1블록을 직접 붙여넣기.

uplus 패턴과 동일: schema = uplus/lgu namespace, input = nms:deliveryMapping form inline.
(custmms / lgu_mms 는 lib ref 없이 nms form 에 pathEdit 만 있음 — default/inputForm/deliveryMapping.xml)

[삽입 위치]
  Form  : nms:deliveryMapping
  Path  : tabMapping → ntbk → tabAddr
  Anchor: @lgu_mms 바로 아래, @email 바로 위

[선행 — schema]
  1. schema/deliveryMapping_uplus.xml → uplus:deliveryMapping
  2. schema/deliveryMapping_lgu.xml   → lgu:deliveryMapping
  3. Update database structure
  4. nms:deliveryMapping Preview → lguMMS attribute 확인

[기존 lgu:deliveryMapping form Import 했으면]
  Input forms → lgu:deliveryMapping 삭제
  nms:deliveryMapping 에서 ref="lgu:deliveryMapping:lib/..." 제거
  → 아래 inline input 으로 교체

[Console Execute — schema vs form 구분]
  var s = application.getSchema("nms:deliveryMapping");
  logInfo("custmms=" + (s.root.children["custmms"] ? "OK" : "MISSING"));
  logInfo("lgu_mms=" + (s.root.children["lgu_mms"] ? "OK" : "MISSING"));
  logInfo("lguMMS=" + (s.root.children["lguMMS"] ? "OK" : "MISSING"));
  // lguMMS MISSING → schema 문제 (form 아님)
  // lguMMS OK + Input forms 미리보기만 에러 → lib form 제거, inline 사용
-->
<!-- === nms:deliveryMapping tabAddr 에 붙여넣을 fragment (1줄) === -->
<!--
        <input nolabel="false" type="pathEdit" useUnboundPath="false" xpath="@lguMMS"
               xpathSchema="/ignored/@dummySchema"/>
-->
